{"abstract":"Dette notat tager udgangspunkt i en fælles bekymring for, hvilke strategiske konsekvenser det forværrede forhold mellem Kina og USA kan få for Danmark. Notatet indeholder en beskrivelse af situationens udvikling, en kortfattet vurdering af de globale konsekvenser, og en diskussion af implikationer for det danske handlerum og af pejlemærker for danske beslutningstagere.","author_count":18,"contributors":["Andersen, Louise Riis","Banke, Cecilia Felicia Stokholm","Breitenbauch, Henrik","Brødsgaard, Kjeld Erik","Høyrup Christensen, Nis","Delman, Jørgen","Forsby, Andreas Bøje","Heurlin, Bertel","Jakobsson, André Ken","Kristensen, Peter Marcus","Kristensen, Kristian Søby","Nørup Sørensen, Camilla Tenna","Thunø, Mette","Wæver, Ole"],"cuid":["S02-090.83-031207"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"com","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-DIIS","DI-GV-FAK"],"OT":["Ukendt"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-DIIS","DI-GV-FAK","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cms notat forværringen af det kinesisk amerikanske forhold en strategisk udfordring for danmark","src":["cbs","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dme","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://cms.polsci.ku.dk/publikationer/forvaerringen-af-det-kinesisk-amerikanske-forhold-en-strategisk-udfordring-for-danmark/CMS_Notat_Strategisk_refleksionsforum_Kina_danske_implikationer_december_2020__002_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-090.83-031207","ids":["cbs-1c4d7110-f284-474e-a0ba-33ce5d45d371","sdu-d9fdc950-5f51-4147-ac32-ccc523200f53"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-9426D9FB34F131A71FA528AF64A826DD"],