{"abstract":"Dette notat tager udgangspunkt i en fælles bekymring for, hvilke strategiske Danmark. Notatet indeholder en beskrivelse af situationens udvikling, en kortfattet vurdering af de globale konsekvenser, og en diskussion af implikationer for det danske handlerum og af pejlemærker for danske beslutningstagere.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Sørensen, Camilla T. N.","Breitenbauch, Henrik Ø.","Andersen, Lotte Riis","Delman, Jørgen","Brødsgaard, Kjeld Erik","Forsby, Andreas Bøje","Kristensen, Kristian Søby","Heurlin, Bertel","André Ken, Jacobsen","Kristensen, Peter Marcus","Wæver, Ole","Thunø, Mette","Banke, Cecilia Felicia Stokholm","Christensen, Nis Høyrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-433021"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Danmark Kina","Det Humanistiske Fakultet"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-DIIS"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-DIIS","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cms notat forværringen af det kinesisk amerikanske forhold en strategisk udfordring for danmark","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dw","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/374645396/CMS_Notat_Strategisk_refleksionsforum_Kina_danske_implikationer_december_2020_002_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-433021","ids":["ku-423aeed4-33fa-4d18-a962-e4aca96e3647"],"keyword":["Danmark-Kina","Dansk underigspolitik","Det Humanistiske Fakultet","Stormagtskonklikt"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EAF59D1D22511BC0E3FD466F2E471862"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/374645396/CMS_Notat_Strateg